# MentorPi Tank STM32 RRC udev serial rule template
# Restricted and verified character device ownership for STM32 RRC chassis controller
# Vendor: 1a86 (QinHeng CH343/CH342), Product: 55d4
# Grants read/write access solely to mentorpi-rrc group, ignores ModemManager probes.

SUBSYSTEM=="tty", KERNEL=="ttyACM*", ATTRS{idVendor}=="1a86", ATTRS{idProduct}=="55d4", GROUP="mentorpi-rrc", MODE="0660", SYMLINK+="rrc", ENV{ID_MM_PORT_IGNORE}="1"
